  "totalBlocks": 33,
  "translatedBlocks": 33,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc6521352f58cf31",
      "translationZh": "本周，在 Dell Tech World 上，我们发布了新版 Dell Enterprise Hub，提供一整套模型和应用，让用户能够借助 Dell AI 服务器和 AI PC，轻松构建在本地运行的 AI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "62c5e42ded2a18d6",
      "translationZh": "模型已准备就绪",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5612709d72c5fc42",
      "translationZh": "现在访问 Dell Enterprise Hub，你就能找到一些最受欢迎的模型，例如 Meta Llama 4 Maverick、DeepSeek R1 或 Google Gemma 3，只需点击几下即可部署和训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9491e3f0402eaf7",
      "translationZh": "但你获得的远不止一个模型，而是一个经过全面测试、针对特定 Dell AI 服务器平台优化的容器，并附有简单易懂的说明，指导你使用 Docker 和 Kubernetes 在本地部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90600c82276582a7",
      "translationZh": "Meta Llama 4 Maverick 可以部署在配备 NVIDIA H200 或 AMD MI300X 的 Dell PowerEdge 服务器上",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15c6e0ae18806ff7",
      "translationZh": "我们持续与 Dell CTIO 和工程团队合作，尽快让最新、最出色的模型在 Dell AI 服务器平台上准备就绪、完成测试并得到优化——在 Meta 公开发布 Llama 4 模型后的 1 小时内，这些模型就已在 Dell Enterprise Hub 上线！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "baee967d1fc1d73f",
      "translationZh": "推出 AI 应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a320974b02ff1f8",
      "translationZh": "Dell Enterprise Hub 现已提供可直接部署的 AI 应用！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51cbf102f9b7cd8e",
      "translationZh": "如果模型是引擎，那么应用就是让引擎发挥作用的汽车，让你真正能够驶向目的地。借助全新的 Application Catalog，你可以为员工构建完全在本地运行的强大应用，并使用你的内部数据和服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79de4f2130db0aa8",
      "translationZh": "全新的 Application Catalog 让你能够轻松在私有网络内部署领先的开源应用，包括 OpenWebUI 和 AnythingLLM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84ff3ad1b97d8165",
      "translationZh": "OpenWebUI 让你能够轻松部署本地聊天机器人助手，通过 MCP 连接内部数据和服务，构建能够搜索网络、利用向量数据库和存储检索内部数据以支持 RAG 用例的智能体体验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "520259d4d57ba3e5",
      "translationZh": "AnythingLLM 让你能够轻松构建强大的智能体助手，连接多个 MCP 服务器，从而接入内部系统，甚至外部服务。它提供了启用多个模型、处理图像和文档，以及为内部用户设置基于角色的访问控制等功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "331147e6eb6aa972",
      "translationZh": "使用所提供的可自定义 helm charts，可以轻松部署这些应用，让你的 MCP 服务器从一开始就完成注册。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e47f630b6ef071d3",
      "translationZh": "由 NVIDIA、AMD 和 Intel 提供支持",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d4b0e5280a48446",
      "translationZh": "Dell Enterprise Hub 是全球唯一一个为最新 AI 加速器硬件提供即用型模型部署解决方案的平台：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b4ba7504142dba8",
      "translationZh": "搭载 NVIDIA H100 和 H200 GPU 的 Dell 平台",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "692c7936fc67cbfd",
      "translationZh": "由 AMD MI300X 驱动的 Dell 平台",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c1f3333d3afbc068",
      "translationZh": "由 Intel Gaudi 3 驱动的 Dell 平台",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30c00f51fa99a4e8",
      "translationZh": "我们直接与 Dell、NVIDIA、AMD 和 Intel 合作，确保当您在系统上部署容器时，一切都已配置就绪，并经过全面测试和基准测试，从而在您的 Dell AI Server 平台上开箱即可以最佳性能运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3158520178dcf9dd",
      "translationZh": "适用于 Dell AI PC 的端侧模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d283a59d5b254fc4",
      "translationZh": "全新的 Dell Enterprise Hub 现在不仅支持 AI 服务器，还支持模型在 Dell AI PC 上进行端侧运行！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8697498124260e51",
      "translationZh": "这些模型支持在端侧实现语音转写（OpenAI whisper）、聊天助手（Microsoft Phi 和 Qwen 2.5）、图像超分辨率放大以及生成嵌入向量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5bb7fb46534aa6ed",
      "translationZh": "要部署模型，您可以使用全新的 Dell Pro AI Studio，按照针对您所选、由 Intel 或 Qualcomm NPU 驱动的 Dell AI PC 的具体说明进行操作。结合 Microsoft Intune 等 PC 设备群管理系统，这是一套完整的解决方案，可帮助 IT 部门为员工提供端侧 AI 能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba094d2db9891c18",
      "translationZh": "现已提供 CLI 和 Python SDK",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c08ac137ef4495b",
      "translationZh": "Dell Enterprise Hub 提供了一个在线门户，让你能够使用 Dell AI Server 平台和 AI PCs 的 AI 能力。但如果你想直接在自己的开发环境中工作呢？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f031832e8160966e",
      "translationZh": "现在推出全新的 dell-ai 开源库，提供 Python SDK 和 CLI，让你可以在自己的环境中，直接通过终端或代码使用 Dell Enterprise Hub——只需运行 pip install dell-ai",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bd1b2e048c00f1a5",
      "translationZh": "总结",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce1c3555a2b87950",
      "translationZh": "Dell Enterprise Hub 为 AI Servers 和 AI PCs 提供模型与应用，可使用 Docker、Kubernetes 和 Dell Pro AI Studio 轻松安装，是一套用于在企业内部署生成式 AI 应用的完整工具包，完全安全且在本地运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4e0d4f98d0cdaa0",
      "translationZh": "作为 Dell 客户，这意味着你可以非常迅速地在一小时内，而不是花费数周时间，完成以下工作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6637d0a5a52aa5e1",
      "translationZh": "推出由最新开放 LLMs 驱动的内网聊天助手，并使用 MCP 将其连接到你的内部存储系统（例如 Dell PowerScale），所有操作都在物理隔离的环境中完成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "43060d4ab68f38f2",
      "translationZh": "提供对复杂智能体系统的访问，配备细粒度访问控制和 SSO；这些系统能够处理内部文本、代码、图像、音频和文档，并访问网络以获取最新背景信息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c6d59bad4cddb4d2",
      "translationZh": "以完全受管的方式，借助一批 Dell AI PCs，为员工配置在设备端运行、保护隐私的转录功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfe7f69ad5d43b3e",
      "translationZh": "如果您目前正在使用 Dell Enterprise Hub，我们很希望在评论区听到您的反馈！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
